                            <comment id="16121622" author="edshanggg" created="Thu, 10 Aug 2017 13:43:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;PR - &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2423&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2423&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
